{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51177","headline":"五言（八首） 四 · 王梵志","name":"五言（八首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良田收百顷，兄弟犹工商。\n却是成忧恼，珠金虚满堂。\n满堂何所用？妻儿日夜忙。\n行坐闻人死，不解暂思量。\n贫儿二亩地，（自「贫儿二亩地」以下，张锡厚另作一首。\n此句《说郛》作「买得贫家地。\n」）乾枯十树桑。\n桑下种粟麦，四时供父娘。\n图谋未入手，只是愿饥荒。\n结得百家怨，此身终受殃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}